        "faq_FVtKfN": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What is a 2 Post Rack?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>A two post racks is for smaller equipment and tends to be in smaller offices. They can also act as support for larger server enclosures. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/open-frame-racks-two-post-vs-four-post-racks\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Open Frame Racks: Two-Post vs. Four-Post Racks\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
