          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What is the Difference Between 2 Post and 4 Post Racks?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>A four post rack has 4 posts instead of two. It also has a larger capacity and a sturdier foundation in comparison to the two post racks. Because the four post racks can hold heavy equipment, they are normally found in serious network set ups. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/open-frame-racks-two-post-vs-four-post-racks\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Open Frame Racks: Two-Post vs. Four-Post Racks\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
