      "blocks": {
        "faq_D83R7F": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What is a Rack Fan?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Rack fans helps ventilate your rack enclosures. This will help improve the performance of your equipment and extend its life. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/5-things-to-consider-when-purchasing-a-rack-system\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"5 Things to Consider When Purchasing a Rack System\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
