          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What is Fiber Optic Termination?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Fiber optic termination in the connection from a fiber cable to a device. It allows for a cross connection and light wave signal distribution. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/fiber-optic-termination\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Fiber Optic Termination\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
