        },
        "faq_yhRh7Q": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What Tools Are Used in Fiber Optic Termination?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>In order to safely terminate your fiber cable, you will need: safety glasses, a fiber disposal bin, connectors, fiber optic cables, epoxy/syringes or Anaerobic adhesive, polishing film, fiber stripper, scribe, yarn scissors, cable jacket stripper, polishing puck, polishing glass plate, rubber pad, power meter, tracer, reference test cables, LED light source, and a microscope. <a href=\"/blogs/articles/fiber-optic-termination\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Fiber Optic Termination\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
          }
