        "faq_nDXEiJ": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_que": "What is So Special About Fiber Optic Cables?",
            "faq_ans": "<p>Unlike copper and metal wiring, fiber optic wiring is much more secure for network applications. They can transmit more information, faster, at greater distances, than their counterparts. And if that's not enough, there is no need for grounding or worrying about electrical interference and corrosion! <a href=\"/blogs/articles/fiber-optics-run-down-features-benefits-safety\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Fiber Optics Run Down: Features, Benefits, Safety\"><strong>...more</strong></a></p>"
          }
